WEBVTT

NOTE
Narration over progressive instrumental music.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.953
Explore the current TravelOS B2B portal. Tours, quote requests, bookings and documents, in one workspace.

2
00:00:11.953 --> 00:00:23.255
Start in Sri Lanka Tours. Compare routes, travel styles, hotel categories and sample rate readiness.

3
00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:32.607
Open a tour to review the day by day programme, hotel plan, inclusions and seasonal sample rate cards.

4
00:00:32.607 --> 00:00:45.442
Browse activities and service options by location. Rates in this public demonstration are fictional and require reconfirmation.

5
00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:55.398
Follow a request through review, preparation and release. The portal keeps traveller requirements and progress together.

6
00:00:55.398 --> 00:01:06.283
Open a released sample quotation to see its status and value. This demo does not send or save requests.

7
00:01:06.283 --> 00:01:16.610
Check booking status, sample payments, remaining balances and operational readiness from the agency view.

8
00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:28.516
Explore the document centre, then request your own guided TravelOS demo at navigeto dot com slash travelos.